<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Perceptron rated outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Perceptron rated outperform.</headline>
<text>
<p>--EVEREN Securities Inc said Wednesday it initiated coverage of Perceptron Inc with an outperformer rating for the six months and 18 months.</p>
<p>--It established a six-month price target on the stock of $40 and an 18-month target of $46. Its 1997 EPS estimate is $1.60 compared to $1.30 in 1996 (excluding a $0.27 per share charge for non-cash compensation expenses). For 1998, EPS are projected at $1.95.</p>
<p>--Perceptron manufactures three-dimensional machine vision systems used to measure critical dimensions of assembled parts. Its stock was off 1/4 at 33-3/4.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
